<title>USA: Galoob Toys prices stock offer at $28.125.</title>
<headline>Galoob Toys prices stock offer at $28.125.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galoob Toys Inc said Wednesday it has priced a public offer of just under 2.4 million common shares at $28.125 a share via managing underwriters Gerard Klauer Mattison &amp; Co LLC, William Blair &amp; Co and Jefferies &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>Two million shares are being offered by the company and 392,866 shares by an unaffiliated party. Galoob has granted the underwriters an over-allotment option of 358,929 shares.</p>
<p>Galoob designs, develops, markets and sells toys worldwide.</p>
</text>
